        "quote": "你们有权在签字前要求把“必要时”讲清楚；这不是拖延，而是有效知情同意。"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00304",
        "explanation": "Doctor corrects the core misconception, distinguishing cervical screening from endometrial pathology, which is central to the clinical direction.",
        "quote": "宫颈筛查阴性只说明宫颈方面风险较低，不能排除子宫内膜病变。"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
