        "quote": "不是拒绝治疗，而是在积极住院的同时保障妈妈充分知情。"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00200",
        "explanation": "Doctor clearly delineates the high-risk nature of complex atypical hyperplasia and the need for timely evaluation, preventing a false sense of security.",
        "quote": "广泛复杂非典型增生”属于子宫内膜癌前病变，确实比较接近癌，但不能仅凭这几行断定已经癌变"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00637",
        "explanation": "Doctor translates the complex biopsy result into a simple, actionable statement for the family to use with the mother, addressing her emotional and practical barriers.",
        "quote": "现在不是通知你一定放化疗，而是把结果补齐，看手术是否已经足够；继续复诊也可能得出只需随访。"
      }
    ]
  },
