      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 is met. The doctor successfully navigates the patient's refusal by validating her fears, providing a structured, non-coercive path to informed consent, and turning the fear of oophorectomy into a negotiable, understandable set of questions.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5_surgery_scope_and_refusal_handling",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
