      "explanation": "RC6 is met. The doctor correctly frames pre-operative tests as safety measures, advises on bringing all relevant records, and avoids making non-contraindicated conditions a central decision-making barrier.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6_preoperative_safety_and_comorbid_context",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00825",
          "explanation": "Closure includes a clear, time-bound plan with specified responsible parties (妇瘤主诊), action items (带报告), and a safety net for acute symptoms.",
          "quote": "3个月后即使没人主动通知，也要由家属主动预约妇瘤主诊复查，不要等电话。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00825",
          "explanation": "Doctor provides a clear, actionable safety net for when to seek emergency care.",
          "quote": "若出现阴道流血增多、腹痛明显加重、发热、切口红肿渗液、胸闷气促或单侧腿肿痛，要提前就医，不等3个月。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC7 is fully met. The final closure includes a clear action plan with responsibility, a time frame, and a well-defined safety net for acute symptoms, and a teaching-back to the family.",
